        {
          "title": "Questions 13-17",
          "text": "PARKING PERMIT RENEWAL\nEmployees may renew campus parking permits beginning September 1. The application form can be [13] from the Human Resources portal. Applications [14] after September 15 may require additional processing time. [15] Employees who no longer need a permit should return it to the security office. Staff members are advised to apply [16] to avoid delays. Thank you for your [17] during the renewal period.",
          "zh": "停车证续期通知\n员工可从 9 月 1 日起为校园停车证办理续期。申请表可以从人力资源门户网站 [13] 下载。9 月 15 日之后 [14] 提交的申请可能需要更多处理时间。[15] 现有的停车证在 9 月 30 日之前都有效。不再需要停车证的员工应把它交回保安室。建议员工 [16] 尽早申请，以免耽搁。感谢您在续期期间的 [17] 耐心等待。"
        }
      ],
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "day3-q13",
          "n": 13,
          "part": 6,
          "kind": "blank",
          "bonus": false,
          "rev": 0,
          "stem": "",
          "options": [
